{"id":"66fcb1175fb50214","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Order Embedding","display":"df-zfc-order10-order-embedding — ZFC Order10 Order Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-order-embedding — ZFC Order10 Order Embedding","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-order-embedding — ZFC Order10 Order Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P)\">\\((P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,\\leq_Q)\">\\((Q,\\leq_Q)\\)</span> (posets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:P\\to Q\">\\(f:P\\to Q\\)</span> (map between their carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in P\">\\(x,y\\in P\\)</span> (source-order comparison variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\operatorname{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land f:P\\to Q\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Q f(y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\operatorname{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land f:P\\to Q\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Q f(y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Order reflection makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> injective by antisymmetry, so no separate injection conjunct is needed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018"